        "published_at": "2018-02-11",
        "checked_at": "2026-10-21",
        "excerpt": "Furner started out at nearly the bottom of the company’s chain of command — as a part-time worker in retail. The internship came after.",
        "tier": 2
      },
      {
        "id": "s16",
        "url": "https://979weve.com/2025/11/14/factbox-who-is-walmarts-new-top-boss/",
